Servei d’acollida (17h a 19)', '', '', '', TRUE, 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/55/55/1783540800000/sI1lsCKmAQimT1jBh0Qkxw/Ak8rqaYHXDzex4WwJN9yzx8fThV-ZlapnFnszzvyWTf_us6O0a0pAvxgqeIuTLRTS3Y8inKJGMLWtqrUnxYMf8UIuzaeY3K091iWEoEw1GyYBYVP9UI_kC8FcAnD2lRtD7WeiOz60SeMdBcg-jHQ4e-fNx0UbVDTnPcd3hKavUeRPQpAWIh14svi7UwbOEIa/7PQk2Fv2xc4DgLP0vt4v_1HENUIsHFmWvuXgAsBt4t0', 'https://v5.airtableusercontent.com/v3/u/55/55/1783540800000/ZMMgfmNMRL0dhT2MU_iAew/WwWMVJ1JLXR-N81arBj8CWHxwmY2RCS68NbfNlbmGA0umkxhogxJ4OvBgor1OxX2nv14K-RYX-qc3_lpZ1PQJsR2oo7B6QOaLnCbLy7dNGqKiEVwqwJls5wooLHnlvLapjcjJ_fsVCWznuQV6ztDnQ/mJj0Yeb1hgUHwO_lJ1UHm2Ho-PonL-S6b_WZyf5brhg', '{}', '', 'Casal', '', '', '', '', 'girona')
